Please extract the following information from the provided resume text and format it precisely as a JSON object. 

Required JSON Structure:
{
  "tech_skills": "comma-separated list of all technical skills and tools",
  "nontech_skills": "comma-separated list of soft skills, languages, and non-technical proficiencies",
  "education": "A brief summary of all educational degrees, universities, and years",
